Derivation from eMule
---------------------
njMule is an independent re-implementation of the eMule file-sharing client.
Protocol constants, file formats and algorithms were translated from the eMule
source code, the lower-case table Kad applies to keywords is taken from eMule's
resource files, and the user-interface strings and their translations are
converted from eMule's resource files.

